The '''Skywalker home''' was where the [[Slavery|slaves]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] and his [[Parent|mother]] [[Shmi Skywalker Lars]] lived in [[Mos Espa]] on the [[desert]] [[planet]] [[Tatooine]].<ref name="Backstories" /> It was located in the [[Slave Quarters Row]] on the city outskirts.<ref name="World Building" /> By the [[time]] the [[Naboo Royal Handmaidens|handmaiden]] [[Sabé]] traveled to Tatooine on behalf of [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] to free Shmi from slavery, Shmi no longer lived in the home and the door had a newly cut symbol of a [[White Suns|white sun]] on it.<ref name="Queen's Shadow">''[[Queen's Shadow]]''</ref>

